# Figma design tokens

Import `spacing`, `radii`, `colors`, and `tokens` from `src/theme/tokens.ts`. Never edit `tokens.ts` by hand — regenerate via `figma_export_tokens` when Figma variables change.

## Figma → code mapping

| Figma variable | Code |
|----------------|------|
| `layout/size/s-*` | `spacing['s-*']` |
| `layout/size/icon` | `spacing.icon` |
| `layout/radius/r-*` | `radii['r-*']` |
| `color/tokens/border-*` | `colors['border-*']` |
| `color/tokens/bg-trans-*` | `colors['bg-trans-*']` |
| `layout/shadow/*` | `tokens.layout.shadow` |

## Transparent color tokens (8-digit hex)

Figma keeps one token per color+alpha (e.g. `bg-trans-2` = `#FFFFFF33`). Do not split into separate Figma variables.

| API | Usage |
|-----|--------|
| `View` styles, `LinearGradient` | `colors['bg-trans-2']` directly |
| `react-native-svg` stops, opacity-only props | `resolveColorToken('bg-trans-2')` → `{ color, opacity }` |

Import `resolveColorToken` from `src/theme/resolveColorToken.ts`. Never pass 8-digit hex to `react-native-svg` `stopColor`.

## Rules

- Border widths: always `spacing['s-1']`, never literal `1`.
- Border colors: use `border-*` role tokens, not `content-*` even when hex matches.
- Before implementing from Figma: check variables via `figma_get_variables`; if a value is missing, add it in Figma first, then re-export.

## Examples

```tsx
// BAD — SVG ignores alpha in 8-digit hex
<Stop stopColor={colors['bg-trans-2']} stopOpacity={1} />

// GOOD — token name visible, color + opacity from Figma hex
const center = resolveColorToken('bg-trans-2');
<Stop stopColor={center.color} stopOpacity={center.opacity} />

// GOOD — LinearGradient supports 8-digit hex
colors={[colors['bg-trans-1'], colors['content-trans-light']]}
```
